# tasks

Ordered checklist. Ralphloop picks the first `[ ]` task each iteration. Mark
done with `[x]`; blocked tasks the loop gives up on are marked `[!]`.

## Phase 1

- [ ] **01** First task — write a one-line description here. The loop reads
      from the start of `**NN**` to end of line as the title; longer notes
      can go in the body of the task or under a sub-bullet.
